{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07439","headline":"饯王相公出牧括州 · 刘长卿","name":"饯王相公出牧括州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缙云讵比长沙远，出牧犹承明主恩。\n城对寒山开画戟，路飞秋叶转朱轓。\n江潮淼淼连天望，旌斾悠悠上岭翻。\n萧索庭槐空闭合，旧人谁到翟公门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}